{
  "name": "Invoke React",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You gain a +[Magic Power] bonus to the amount of HP recovered when you use &laquo;Reactive Heal&raquo; or &laquo;Reactive Area Heal&raquo;. This effect lasts until the end of the round.</p>\n<p>(Fate 1): If you have reached your Limit for this skill, you may pay this cost to use it again.<br>(Hate 2): If you have reached your Limit for this skill, you may pay this cost to use it again.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Magic that amplifies the effects of reaction-activated recovery by performing informal rituals with prayer words and signs.</p>",
